        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "In Konami's ESPN Winter X Games Snowboarding players can relive the popular alternative sport with detailed ESPN integration and identical courses from the 2001 season. Authentic broadcast angles, in-depth rider statistics, and 15 of the world's best pro riders are just a few of the features at their disposal while other extras include real snowboarding gear, four true-to-life X Games events (including Super Pipe and Big Air), three different gameplay modes with support for up to five players, and a killer soundtrack that features Long Beach Dub Allstars, Primer 55, Goldfinger, and more.",
